e landlord’s play with any combination other than a bomb or rocket. I don’t have a bomb. The only option is the rocket, but using it here wastes a precious resource when my teammate may be able to handle the current play (they still have 17 cards and possibly stronger combos). Passing avoids squandering the rocket prematurely.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
